<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian wages headed in right direction - Reith.</title>
<headline>Australian wages headed in right direction - Reith.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRNS, Australia 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Workplace Relations Minister Peter Reith on Thursday welcomed second quarter wages data, saying they showed wage outcomes were headed in the right direction, but warned against excessive future wage claims.</p>
</text>
